      "text": "# TRU FISH\n\nFM 21-76. Fish where they gather, or in a run. Line from cloth threads in groups of three, or a shoelace, or suspension line. Bait from fish guts, kept moving. A light at night and shade in the day draw them. Teeth and spines cut. Poison is a gap.\n"
